      "id": "claim_731d42bca6fc425dbcb7115253693f38",
      "statement": "Gatekeeper sign-in: startGatekeeperLogin checks the allowlist and providesAuth, creates a PendingLogin DO (random id), hands the gatekeeper a LoginConnectCallbackImpl, and returns {url, attempt} where attempt is a capability stub — the client never sees a guessable id; on complete(user) the callback reads the provider-verified email, resolves/creates the email-keyed user DO (blocking first-time creation when signups are closed), mints a session, and delivers \"<email>:<secret>\" which resolves the awaiting attempt.wait().",
